  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Caution",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The Venerable placements come from fan sources rather than a pinned chapter. Sources disagree on Early Antiquity Era versus Late Antiquity Era before the present age. This page states nothing about where Heavenly Court sits on the map, and nothing about the origin date of the regional walls.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources do not agree on the name of the age immediately before the present age.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sources conflict:",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The question is open.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "An Immortal Venerable is a rank nine righteous Gu Master.",
      "chapters": [
        383
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "name-in-the-succession",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_righteous_path"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Who the novel places in Remote Antiquity.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "era-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "During the Remote Antiquity Era, Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable and Star Constellation Immortal Venerable appeared, leading humans to resist the rule of variant humans.",
      "chapters": [
        912
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "era-roster",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_primordial_origin_immortal_venerable",
        "char_star_constellation_immortal_venerable"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "How far back this era’s founding of Heavenly Court sits from the present.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "distance-from-the-present",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court was created three million years ago during the Remote Antiquity Era.",
      "chapters": [
        1070
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "distance-from-the-present",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Which paths those two Venerables created.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paths-founded-in-this-era",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "In the Remote Antiquity Era, Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable created qi path and enslavement path, and Star Constellation Immortal Venerable created wisdom path and star path.",
      "chapters": [
        1323
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "paths-founded-in-this-era",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "path_wisdom"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Primordial Origin founding Heavenly Court by name.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sect-naming",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable sets the example for the sect system and states that his sect will be named Heavenly Court.",
      "chapters": [
        1738
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "sect-naming",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Primordial Origin’s true inheritance changing hands.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "true-inheritance-changes-hands",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_primordial_origin_true_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long gives Primordial Origin’s true inheritance to Qi Sea Ancestor, to be handed over in portions.",
      "chapters": [
        1846
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "true-inheritance-changes-hands",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_duke_long",
        "char_qi_sea_ancestor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The list of the ten Venerables by era, and the three-million-year frame.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-venerables-by-antiquity-block",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Looking across a period of over three million years from past to present, ten Gu cultivators stand at the peak. That list places Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable and Star Constellation Immortal Venerable in the Remote Antiquity Era, three million years ago. Among the ten venerables there are nine males and one female.",
      "chapters": [
        2085
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ten-venerables-by-antiquity-block",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Star Constellation Immortal Venerable died.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-constellation-chronology",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Star Constellation Immortal Venerable died three million years ago during the Remote Antiquity Era.",
      "chapters": [
        2086
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "star-constellation-chronology",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Primordial Origin’s revival as a live Heavenly Court plan.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qi-harvest-fruit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Star Constellation Immortal Venerable tells the truth of the qi harvest fruit and Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable’s revival.",
      "chapters": [
        2324
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qi-harvest-fruit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "What happens when that revival arrives.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "central-continent-crisis",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Primordial Origin Immortal Venerable explodes upon revival, and many of Central Continent’s Gu Immortals die with the collapse of that righteous path’s pillars.",
      "chapters": [
        2330
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "central-continent-crisis",
